From: Carlos Ciconato <354919267+CarlosCiconato@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:06:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Injection time (ms) fuel strategy (pro-style main
 map)

New fuelAlgorithm LM_INJ_TIME: a 16x16 RPM x MAP/TPS table holds the
injector pulse at 14 V with deadtime included. The pulse is converted to
fuel mass at the reference deadtime and base flow, so CLT/IAT/baro/AE,
closed loop, voltage and fuel pressure compensation all still apply.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
